msgid "ReliefNT 内核文档"
msgstr "ReliefNT Kernel Documentation"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 是 ReliefOS 的独立 x86_64 内核。 本手册说明启动、源码部件、公开接口和验证边界；不包含用户态应用或镜像安装器。 Linux ABI "
"是已实现接口的兼容目标，不代表完整标准认证。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT is the standalone x86_64 kernel of ReliefOS. This manual describes booting, source "
"components, public interfaces, and validation boundaries; it does not cover userspace applications"
" or the image installer. The Linux ABI is the compatibility target for implemented interfaces, not"
" a claim of full standards certification."
